{"product_id":"eat-wheat","title":"Eat Wheat","description":"\u003cp\u003eAre you gluten-free or dairy-free? If so, you might not have to be. \"Eat Wheat\" is a scientific and clinically-proven approach to addressing food intolerances. After 3.4 million years of eating wheat and only 500,000 years of hunting meat, humans are actually genetically better equipped to eat wheat than meat. This book is your guide to safely bringing wheat and dairy back into your diet. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: John Droulliard \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781683500094 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 318\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44968441381017,"sku":"14RG9781683500094","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6c823af9cd6f7b66ac60af595e0e029c.jpg?v=1732002711","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/eat-wheat","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}